    "title": "Seattle's Top Chefs Line Up to Cook for FareStart Through Year's End - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Emily Tran ,\n1 days ago Seattle diners looking for a good meal for a good cause have a packed calendar ahead: FareStart has announced its Guest Chef Night lineup running through the end of 2026, and it reads like a highlight reel of the city's most talked-about kitchens. Canlis, Ramie, Surrell and Joule are all sending chefs into FareStart's Denny Triangle restaurant to cook alongside students in the nonprofit's job-training program, with $60 three-course dinners funding the organization's work supporting people experiencing homelessness and other economic hardship. Read full article",
